directory './cluster/members/member0/oldetc' (134.8001).                 =
            =20
15:14:09 | FIXED | Added directory entry 'fixfdmn_lost_file_664.8031' to =
directory 134 in fileset 'root'.                                         =
   =20

Now I can delete the recovered rc.config and oldetc directory.

Thanks all for your help.



