Hello again,

 

I've received numerous responses about installing ERP patches to fix this
issue. I've obtained the specific ERP patch:

TCRKIT0024683-V51BB25-E-20050116 and attempted to install it as a
non-rolling upgrade (b/c the cluster is still being rebuilt.)

 

When I run dupatch I immediately get the warning that the patch kit does not
contain patches for my version of UNIX. (I18N_UNIX_5.1B) I ignore it and
proceed. When I get to the Check and Installation part and run that it shows
me the things to patch (Tru64 UNIX 5.1b and TruCluster) I select to install
all of them. Then I get the error that OSF.image is not contained in the
patch and it dies. However, when I do a find on the directory, that file is
indeed there (patch_tools/instctrl/OSF.image).

 

Should I download the patch again? I'm also concerned about the warning that
these patches don't apply to my system.

 

Thanks again folks.

Sheldon.

 

 

