<p class=3DMsoNormal><font size=3D2 face=3DArial><span =
style=3D'font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Arial'>Storage behind adapters such as&nbsp; KZPAC and KZPCC =
become
inaccessible on<br>
installing V5.1B PK4/BL25.&nbsp; The problem occurs because a new =
interface was<br>
introduced in BL25 which requires the underlying driver to implement =
the<br>
DEV_GET_EEI data structure.&nbsp; Some drivers, such as i2o and =
re_driver, have<br>
not implemented this data structure, and consequently DRD =
incorrectly<br>
interprets the response from these drivers.</span></font><o:p></o:p></p>

