Hello Managers,

I am eagerly looking for information on configuring anything to do with =
IGMP on Tru64 5.1B.

In particular, the IGMP timers employed by the host are of interest to =
me. RFC 1112 states that delays are chosen randomly between 1 and D =
seconds, where maximum report delay D can be 10s. In practice on Tru64 =
5.1B observations have been between 1 and 4s, but I would like to know =
if it is possible to tune it lower somehow to a maximum of 3s.

Any information is greatly appreciated.

Best regards,
Michael


